{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MAW is a detective RPG about a queer officer who is struggling with his identity in a repressive society.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_state.png?t=1750529807\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_03.gif?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the state and investigate crimes. Keep your identity hidden, there would be consequences if the state would find out... or worse, if your mother would.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_sniff.png?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_01.gif?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your animal instincts to find clues. Sniff, lick, listen to get information. Talk with other animals. Observe them. Interrogate them. Flirt with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_story2.png?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_02.gif?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the decisions you make are remembered by other characters. Different story lines and interactions will unlock based on your actions and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_story3.png?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of MAW is loosely based on personal experiences. Characters and events are fictional. Emotions and everyday struggles depicted in this game are real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic narrative - Characters react to your decisions, stats, appearance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animal instincts - Use animal abilities (sniffing, licking, etc.) to find clues, explore the environment and interact with other characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable appearance - Wear different outfits and see how the world reacts to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to date and build relationship with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectible cards with unique furry art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal queer story based on real world experiences</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273860?t=1750529807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273860?t=1750529807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/db9e81cfa9f91bbb8ac5dfef8a634f9662e6b330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750529807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/db9e81cfa9f91bbb8ac5dfef8a634f9662e6b330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750529807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"MAW deals with adult queer themes. Some dialogues contain references to sexual acts. Optional collectible magazines feature some drawings of adult characters in suggestive posses. Violence is always only suggested and/or pixelated (censored)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MAW is a detective RPG about a queer officer who is struggling with his identity in a repressive society.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_state.png?t=1750529807\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_03.gif?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the state and investigate crimes. Keep your identity hidden, there would be consequences if the state would find out... or worse, if your mother would.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_sniff.png?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_01.gif?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your animal instincts to find clues. Sniff, lick, listen to get information. Talk with other animals. Observe them. Interrogate them. Flirt with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_story2.png?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_02.gif?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the decisions you make are remembered by other characters. Different story lines and interactions will unlock based on your actions and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_story3.png?t=1750529807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of MAW is loosely based on personal experiences. Characters and events are fictional. Emotions and everyday struggles depicted in this game are real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic narrative - Characters react to your decisions, stats, appearance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animal instincts - Use animal abilities (sniffing, licking, etc.) to find clues, explore the environment and interact with other characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable appearance - Wear different outfits and see how the world reacts to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to date and build relationship with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectible cards with unique furry art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal queer story based on real world experiences</p></li></ul>","developers":["Zakroutil"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/header.jpg?t=1750529807","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121665,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie480.mp4?t=1749908957","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie_max.mp4?t=1749908957"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121665/7192defcdba6cd592f88aee0b9a7803ac96c3cf2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749908957","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie480_v